zh_CN.Numerical core for lane-based gel densit:
Numerical core for lane-based gel densitometry (NumPy only).

The module has no Qt dependency.  Coordinates use the processed image frame;
``x0/x1`` and peak ``left/right`` are inclusive/exclusive pixel boundaries.

